OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1793062101
OL,3,CHarry Kane crowned first English
OL,4,CBallon d'Or winner in 25 years
OL,6,FHarry Kane has become the first
OL,7,FEnglish winner of the Ballon d'Or in
OL,8,F25 years after being honoured at
OL,9,FLondon Palladium on Monday night.
OL,11,FMichael Owen was the last player from
OL,12,FEngland to receive the prestigious
OL,13,Findividual accolade in 2001, but
OL,14,FKane's incredible 73-goal haul last
OL,15,Fseason for club and country earned him
OL,16,Fthe award from French magazine France
OL,17,FFootball.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
