OL,3,CHarry Kane crowned first English
OL,4,CBallon d'Or winner in 25 years
OL,6,F"First of all, thanks again to France
OL,7,FFootball and the Ballon d'Or for this
OL,8,Famazing event. Being in London, it is
OL,9,Fextra special, it felt like a good
OL,10,Fomen.
OL,12,F"Thank you to everyone for voting for
OL,13,Fme. I can imagine it was very tough.
OL,14,FThank you to everyone that voted for
OL,15,Fme."
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
