OL,3,CHarry Kane crowned first English
OL,4,CBallon d'Or winner in 25 years
OL,6,FKane, who thanked England, Bayern and
OL,7,Fformer club Tottenham, said: "To my
OL,8,Fwife Kate, my best friend. We've been
OL,9,Fthrough ups and downs. You are my
OL,10,Fbiggest support and I felt like you
OL,11,Fwanted this more than me.
OL,13,F"The anxious wait... Here it is, we
OL,14,Fdone it and you always want the best
OL,15,Ffor me. You sacrifice yourself to make
OL,16,Fme achieve my dreams.
OL,18,F"This wouldn't be possible without you
OL,19,Fand it is something we can celebrate,
OL,20,Fnot me. We're a team. I can't wait to
OL,21,Fcelebrate tonight. I love you."
OL,26,@oD@^OUuD@AOUzD@AOU}D@_O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
