OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1793062101
OL,3,CHarry Kane crowned first English
OL,4,CBallon d'Or winner in 25 years
OL,6,FHe added: "It's just the journey. For
OL,7,Fany young boy or girl who wants to
OL,8,Fachieve their dream, anything is
OL,9,Fpossible.
OL,11,F"I hope my journey, it wasn't
OL,12,Fstraightforward, I didn't go straight
OL,13,Fto the top, I had to experience a lot
OL,14,Fof loan moves and fight my way to get
OL,15,Fto where I am now. I hope that can
OL,16,Fgive you inspiration and thank you
OL,17,Fvery much."
OL,26,@nD@KOUsD@AOUyD@KO]
